From: SRNet <121732083+SRNet-lab@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Mon, 12 Oct 2026 00:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 3/5] Exit auth: drop lease sessions at expiry; cache admission
 store

- ExitLeaseAuthResult carries the lease exp (latest valid record wins, so a
  renewal extends it).
- SessionEndpoint tracks lease-admitted inbound sessions (LeaseTracker) and
  tick() re-validates them at exp and every 15 s (revocation); sessions whose
  lease is gone are closed with send_close. Whitelist/token sessions are not
  tracked.
- StoreCache: re-read the admissions file only when size/mtime/inode change.
- Tests: renewal exp, tracker due/sweep, end-to-end expiry drop, cache reload.
